31	     * Initializes all fields with the appropriate list of animal,
32	     * habitat and climate change scenario choices as well as the GUIHandler
33	     * currently governing the GUI.
34	     *
35	     * @param handler (GUIHandler) the GUIHandler currenly handling the GUI.
